<div id="careers" class="container-main my-section2x">
  <%= render 'section_heading', locals: {
    title: 'Our current open positions',
    pill: 'We’re hiring',
    description: 'Whether we have an open position or not, we’re always looking for fantastic humans to join us on this wild adventure. No need for a formal cover letter: just tell us about yourself, that’s what we care about.'
  } %>

  <div class="flex flex-col gap-24">
    <%= render 'page_about/open_position', title: "Fullstack Engineer", href: "https://bumpsh.notion.site/Senior-Full-Stack-Engineer-FR-1911fc8d7017802aa481d72b9868046b" do %>
      <p>We’re looking for a Senior Full-stack Developer (Rails, JS, Hotwire, ViewComponent, etc...) with a strong interest in both backend and frontend development to help us build and improve our API platform.</p>
      <p>We’re a France-based, remote-first team aiming to create the best API documentation tool, without compromising on work-life balance: low-meeting culture, generous time off, full health coverage, and more.</p>
    <% end %>
  </div>
</div>
